{
  "about": "Two copies of a machine as they lie on a player’s account, packed by the packer as it stood on main at fbe64572 (format 1, the only format there was), imported from a copy of main’s pack.ts and not from this branch. They are here so that a copy written before format 2 is read for good. The first is the save in save-with-jewels-before-the-payout-works.json (storage version 6, which is what main saved that day), and unpacks to that save’s text, character for character. The second is a machine of storage version 7, the payout works, written by that branch’s own serialize at 9b5a7b23: seed 7 fed for twelve seconds, then a prize of eighty pouring out of the hopper’s doors while seventy-five go up as towers on their lifts, and a jewel let go from the hatch. Its text is not kept here; what is kept is how long it is and its SHA-256. The marks are made up.",
